    "text": "Who Was Charlie Kirk? - WW Ep348\nWhat is the legacy of Charlie Kirk? What was he working for and towards? Don’t miss this very important show that covers how deep the political, ideological, and racial rifts truly are. The fractures are so great it’s virtually impossible to heal. That doesn’t mean that there won't be an attempt to glue and scotch tape humpty dumpty back together again. In order to \"unify\" a broken civilization there are only a few methods that can be taken and they are terrifying for everyone and it most likely won’t work long term anyway. We also cover a few other stories on Sweden's spat with Hungary & Tommy Robinson's \"free speech nationalism\".\nWatch with a membership on any of these platforms:",
